@startuml states_bunch
' SIMPA - States: Bunch lifecycle (RF-21 to RF-25)
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam StateBorderColor #006633

[*] --> Inflorescence

Inflorescence : developing female entity
Inflorescence --> Anthesis : reaches receptivity\n(yellow or black coloring)

Anthesis : pollination window (EV-03)
Anthesis --> Pollinated : pollinator is applied\n[RF-13]
Anthesis --> Aborted : window missed

Pollinated : bunch development
Pollinated --> Developing : fruit formation

Developing : ~6 months from anthesis (EV-02)
Developing --> Green : detached fruits < threshold
Developing --> Affected : pest or disease detected

Green : not fit for cutting [RD-07: do not classify by color]
Green --> Ripe : detached fruits >= variety threshold\n[RF-21]

Ripe : fit for cutting
Ripe --> Overripe : remains uncut
Ripe --> Harvested : cutting is performed\n[records cutDate]

Overripe : raises oil acidity (EV-08)
Overripe --> Harvested : late cutting

Affected --> Discarded : irreversible damage
Affected --> Developing : effective treatment

Harvested : awaiting dispatch
Harvested --> Dispatched : leaves for the mill\n[RF-25 starts window count]
Harvested --> Degraded : exceeds recommended window\n[24 h hybrid / shorter for guineensis]

Degraded --> Dispatched : dispatched with warning

Dispatched --> Accepted : grading compliant\n[RF-23]
Dispatched --> Penalized : green/overripe > threshold\n[RF-22, RF-24]
Dispatched --> Rejected : non-compliant load\n[returned to grower]

Accepted --> [*]
Penalized --> [*]
Rejected --> [*]
Aborted --> [*]
Discarded --> [*]

note right of Penalized
  RF-24: the penalty is traced back
  to the block, the cut date, and
  the responsible crew (EV-04).
end note
@enduml
